      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/da6949/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-12T08:45:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It's soon shipping day, so let's have some fun.&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiling_imp.png?v=9\" title=\":smiling_imp:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiling_imp:\">  I don't know if it was ever already mentioned (I tried to search and found nothing).</p>\n<p>I recently re-read the flavor texts of the Time Cataclysm cards, and something hit me. In the flavor text for Tendrils of Madness, AZ calls Visionary \"Vanessa\".</p>\n<p>It's nothing special, really - but, when reading it, I thought it was strange for these two to use their first names, especially in a strange situation as this. Could it suggest that they are closer than it appears ? Probably not \"lovers\", but at least very close friends ? There are other cards in the game where we see both of them together - suggesting that they sometimes \"work\" as a duo. I should browse them all again and make a list ( first to come to mind is the red dust card in Wagner where they both are, hum, dusting their costume).</p>\n<p>They both are \"outcasts\", in their own way : she is not of this time and reality, he is ridden with guilt.&nbsp; He can't survive without his suit, she is&nbsp; slowly dying. He can't control his power without his modules - she can control the powers of others ( reminds me of Jean Grey/Cyclops ). He feels guilty about his past - she risked everything to change hers…</p>\n<p>So, at least they seem to be a good \"pair\" of heroes to team together - if not a secret couple  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\">  My personal theory is that they feel comfortable near each other, and have a strong friendship, with shades of something more. They are not the romantic kind, so rather than dating, they do heroic things together.</p>\n<p>The fact is that I'd like to see comics about this two people team !</p>\n<p>Anyway - this little \"Vanessa\" thing obssessed me for days, I had to let it out  <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"></p>",
